  "coverage": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Salary tables from Ipotesi CCNL Comparto Sanità 2022-2024 (ARAN, 14.01.2025, definitively signed October 2025). Art. 58 comma 1 (increments from 1.1.2024 per Tabella 1a), Art. 58 comma 2 (annual amounts from Tabella 2a). Monthly values = Tabella 2a / 12."
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Tranche 1 (2022-11-02) values back-calculated from CCNL 2.11.2022 base by subtracting Tabella 1a increments. 2022-2023 anticipation payments (Art. 47-bis D.Lgs. 165/2001) not modelled as separate periods (SIMPLIFICATION)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "Hourly divisor 156 from Art. 26 comma 1 (36h/week standard working time for comparto Sanità)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "source",
        "text": "13 mensilità from Art. 57 (Tredicesima mensilità) of this CCNL."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Layer 2 implemented. Part-time: engine scales by part_time_pct. Fixed-term: PA is excluded from NASpI addizionale (lavoratori delle pubbliche amministrazioni in statutory exclusion list per INPS guidance); fixed_term_additional_rate=0.000 in tax file. Apprenticeship: no ARAN CCNL defines percentage or under-classification tracks; narrow high-qualification form under D.Lgs. 81/2015 Art. 47 exists for research profiles but is not operationalized in any examined CCNL."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Seniority via DEP (Differenziali Economici di Professionalità) per Art. 60 Fondo incarichi: selective procedure, not automatic — maximum_count=0."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Indennità di specificità infermieristica (Art. 62, Tabella 3) not modelled as fixed_allowance — applies only to specific nursing profiles (infermieri, ostetriche), not universally to all area members."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "CNEL code S205 from secondary source (lavoro-economia.it). Not stated in official ipotesi PDF."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Pre-2024 base values derived by back-calculation from CCNL 2.11.2022; 2022-2023 anticipation payments not modelled as intermediate periods."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Agreement date 2025-10-27 (firma definitiva) per ARAN press release. The PDF used is the Ipotesi from 14.01.2025; salary tables are identical to the final signed version."
      }
    ],
    "gross": "implemented",
    "net": "implemented"
  },
